@startuml
title Sequence Diagram 1: User Login with Account Lockout (F1)
autonumber
actor "User" as P0
participant "React UI" as P1
participant "Auth API" as P2
participant "Auth Service" as P3
participant "Database" as P4
participant "Audit Logger" as P5
P0 -> P1 : Enter email and password
P1 -> P2 : POST /api/auth/login
P2 -> P3 : login(email, password)
P3 -> P4 : Find user by email
P4 --> P3 : User record
alt account active and not locked
P3 -> P3 : Compare bcrypt hash
alt password correct
P3 -> P4 : Reset failed attempts
P3 -> P5 : Log LOGIN_SUCCESS
P3 --> P2 : Signed JWT (60 min)
P2 --> P1 : 200 {token, user}
P1 --> P0 : Open role dashboard
else wrong password
P3 -> P4 : Add failed attempt, lock at 5
P3 -> P5 : Log LOGIN_FAILURE
P2 --> P1 : 401 Invalid email or password
end
else locked or deactivated
P2 --> P1 : 423 Account locked / 403 Deactivated
end
@enduml
